      "message": "Ah, I see. Thank you! I can spruce this up once we decide where we are traversing the nodes (here to accumulate the data or elsewhere, such as if we return `ShaderInfo` as you suggested in https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/820157/comment/262146ff_1f7cf0ce/). Leaving as unresolved for now.",
