      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T17:33:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right that the shader nodes become garbage if the `ShaderInfo` goes away. Since we can\u0027t move it as a value type, we\u0027d have to add ` std::unique_ptr\u003cShaderInfo\u003e` to the `FragSkSLInfo` struct.\n\nOn the other hand, almost everything that is stored on `FragSkSLInfo` is determined by `ShaderInfo`, so with a little re-arranging of exactly when the sksl is generated and adding some accessors, I think we could just remove FragSkSLInfo in favor of `BuildFragmentSkSL` returning a `std::unique_ptr\u003cShaderInfo\u003e`.\n\nBut I agree that these are not blockers for this CL, but will be things to keep in mind for when the data traversal is implemented in the vulkan backend.",
      "parentUuid": "5ab4f1eb_923c0bc4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 206,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 213,
        "endChar": 13
      },
